This revision incorporates verified 2026 evidence, corrects statistical claims, and specifies the dynamical model required to make the framework executable. The central research question remains: **how do local disruptions in AI compute, energy infrastructure, and strategic supply chains propagate into systemic crises, and which interventions reduce that propagation without transferring unacceptable costs?**

