| Parameter | Symbol | Source / Basis | Uncertainty |
|-----------|--------|---------------|-------------|
| Electricity-to-compute elasticity | \(\gamma\) | Estimated from data-centre backup power specs | 0.5–2.0 |
| Chip inventory duration | \(\tau_{\text{chip}}\) | Semiconductor industry inventory data | 30–90 days |
